    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="a53a9003-5c54-51d7-8324-e85e41cb3733" activityNameId="aa728f9b-3524-5b24-a05e-a3e194a3ccdc" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">LCD module, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: LCD module, at plant
Data are based on information in a US-EPA study about computer screens. The data represent a current 15-inch LCD computer screen at the end of the 90s. No major updates were found from the available public literature. 2023 updates are related to global material input and new background datasets at the inventory level.; UUID: 3d917e88-9896-3d82-a592-92ac2b569b77
This module includes the various parts of the complete LCD module. All further efforts (auxiliaries, energy, emissions, waste, …) are included in a separate module – that is linked to this module here.
Location: Data from literature – used as data for the global composition average
Technology: a-Si TFT LCD module
Time period: Unspecified
Production volume: n.a.
Sampling: literature &amp; own estimations
Extrapolations: see generalComment
Uncertainty adjustments: None
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_3d917e88-9896-3d82-a592-92ac2b569b77.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
